[00:08.01]
[00:10.01]（浮华之世，在所难免，我们会不在意的。）
[00:22.01]
[00:24.30]is anybody out there
[00:27.50]i’m in fear i get lost
[00:36.39]there is a mountain full of scary dark birds
[00:39.59]and a river they call it Valley Crow
[00:47.81]unutterable chilling sense up in front
[00:59.85]anonymous letters swirling around
[01:11.85]it all caused my imaginary hearing all night long
[01:40.66]how i end up here
[01:45.10]i staring at the moon
[01:48.82]ask her where i came from
[01:57.05]endless time
[02:00.25]nameless by
[02:04.48]crossing all my limitation
[02:12.54]lost my passion i can't describe it
[02:20.18]it just feels so down
[02:28.06]lost my direction but i can't regret it
[02:36.04]god knows where to move on
[02:43.62]this chapter is over, but the book is not
